Output docs/assets/demo/switcher.gif

Hide
Type "./bin/sltty -demo"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

# Quick switcher: # keeps channels, @ keeps people.
Ctrl+K
Sleep 600ms
Type "#tools"
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+K
Sleep 400ms
Type "@ca"
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Message search, Slack syntax: words, in:#channel, from:@person.
Ctrl+F
Sleep 400ms
Type "runner"
Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms
